Subject: SEAS API – GTS Integration Details for DEV

Hi Team,

The SEAS API setup for GTS is ready in the DEV environment. We have completed testing from our side and are able to get a successful response.

Please find the integration details below.

Environment: DEV

API Endpoint:
https://seas-dev.ups.com/seas/api/employees/{employeeId}

Method:
GET

GTS Service Account:
emp-ep-apigateway-gts@gcp-emp-ep-dev.iam.gserviceaccount.com

JWT Audience:
GTS

Authentication:
Please generate a JWT using the GTS service account above, with the audience (aud) set to GTS.

Please send the generated JWT as a Bearer token:

Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>

Example request:

GET https://seas-dev.ups.com/seas/api/employees/{employeeId}

We have validated the setup from our side using the GTS service account and a JWT with audience GTS, and received a successful response.

Please test from your side and let us know if you have any issues or need any additional information.

